ce_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 所有的部落基地被摧毁，他们的首领被杀死了，高阶太阳骑士艾琳应该对这个消息感到很高兴！#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f02e23896acd5d157e60ad4e0957e983b441bb297028dcae2bd7328dda4a6a7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"269a0d3a1b9498d60d7e99244c75205c69788db3321de2512f75719101923aae","logical_entry_identity":"730c0deba3e390e624fbfce38badc474c0717635d6c156f5fffcc42335cd3267","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"[continue]","source_tag":"_t","target":"[继续]"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa0ea1c14080c6ae954062b3702d32c64ea721213e33dd26afacd761f2811e4e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"269bacbab35f66667bfad56105e116c65ac9d87a86596f09830fbb3d95214799","logical_entry_identity":"488d2e3e776d14e6686dbffbc5eb909443dd393646de457957ee319147042b67","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is taking %0.2f nature damage per turn from a potent earth-based poison.  In %d more turn(s), or when the poison has run its course (%d%% chance), the target will be turned to stone for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标每回合受到来自强效土系毒素的 %0.2f 自然伤害。在 %d 回合后，或者毒素效果结束时（%d%% 几率），目标将被石化 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d5a1361fff528350c2b89ba919e1dff12f6d3db9e1169a0a2e0d1ec51f3106ad","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"269c0343aae6a94a70eb8c1f6cf3db7fe13b0a8a91a98375b8d43edd7a1bf3f9","logical_entry_identity":"59a907a0657cad0a8c9e49be870da99aff8d4ed019e815afeef6925025ca554c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I hereby stand victorious, awaiting future challenges!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我已胜利加冕，静候未来的挑战！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f366c6c975cf7773a75a4e457198cf7b05aed9eb9b5fcfc269bfc4738a1f763","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"269f6ddfb651a4495f8694d741bf3c3553a6bd623d2158fb858c617e9450c76f","logical_entry_identity":"36cd2f9cee59ff7f59f3d807d6e54fb6e937c02f43a9791d935418d28a253751","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lay a trap that activates a lethal contraption of whirling blades, lasting %d turns.  This stationary construct is very durable, receives your damage bonuses, and automatically attacks all adjacent enemies each turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"放置一个陷阱，触发后会启动由旋转刀刃组成的致命装置，持续 %d 回合。这个固定装置非常坚固，继承你的伤害加成，并在每回合自动攻击所有相邻敌人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c93e1f3beccf848fadc2aca0aa2d23ab9ab53fdd4a5977d95d662027f2db868e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26a2ea1dfb9339a73bc61da3fc01c2e342d486be776e249388c8968752540632","logical_entry_identity":"2e06e8a3eb052502e0b6c01a24868f174cbe41b98c173d07b11dca5d43b45cab","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"And boy were all the rumors about unreliable adventurers true. I'd heard that many, many escorted people die when their adventurer flees and protects himself. It is TRUE. Once I got an escort, I headed off in the right direction immediately. However, for some reason, he did not immediately follow, let alone lead. Didn't he know the way to go? Foolish man. Why am I offering my special trainings to someone who doesn't even know where the local portals are! Fortunately I survived, but no thanks to him. I won't even mention his snoring...\nThis Thanchir guy really, really needs to find a more urban spot with accessible public transportation (no adventurers please!). However, once I could get him to talk, he did know quite a bit. Apparently, he claims some distant kinship to the first Elf in these parts. They arrived by boat from some legendary land called \"Maj'Eyal\". He says that it definitely exists, but could provide no real evidence. This should be investigated further","source_tag":"_t","target":"好家伙，关于冒险者不可靠的传闻果然全都是真的。我听说许许多多被护送者都因冒险者丢下他们逃命自保而死。这事千真万确！找到护卫后，我立刻朝正确的方向出发。可不知为何，他没有马上跟来，更别说走在前面带路了。他难道不知道该往哪儿走吗？蠢货。一个连当地传送门在哪儿都不知道的人，我为什么还要把自己的特殊训练传授给他！幸好我活了下来，但可没有半点他的功劳。我甚至都不想提他打呼噜的事……\n桑切尔这人真的、真的该找个更像城市、公共交通也更方便的地方住下（请别再派冒险者了！）。不过好不容易让他开口后，他知道的东西倒真不少。据他说，他与最早来到这一带的那位精灵有些远亲关系。那位精灵乘船从一个叫“马基·埃亚尔”的传奇之地来到这里。桑切尔坚称那个地方确实存在，却拿不出任何实质证据。此事值得进一步调查。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d628c6be1be47d6175e9cf9046c7f7eae51caf7385a055e07656d9a9082dde2a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26a565523f5badaca08aebd3714136e13b00a8f682bb98c9b72127e4326e3cc9","logical_entry_identity":"5c5daa4e5cf4877bf64eadac7e010d2c5dc8623c7baa008eafce8c8ad0e9e358","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot use your %s anymore.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你不能使用你的%s了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d202c6a98c9f82f140f9fed5ec219d29b21210646d375d70f93e9790ff91fcaf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26a6fa450a00e2df847584666ed8c36198595b099ef63359417aefb42db57e86","logical_entry_identity":"33cb3ab287e072b15ede4082155c1fd03fc6507df519bc9f1f2ee34c7ef30c8a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dark tendril","source_tag":"_t","target":"黑暗触须"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"af92ca24c11ecc029f36771f0f7d46dc40386825eca320f72afd6e9716544381","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26adf6a02f9f3da0ef4befd54bd514c97197cb53e62468d3caa5dea4f346f056","logical_entry_identity":"c9219dc68906e6fa07683c46c8991d14e420fb141db68cd917b79204b1e5b8d8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You remove your %s.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你移除了你的%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6a5ef5c972909bf9174b6fe7ac92a95d339aa11be0fcc6b52b9589209edb1a52","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26b7fb57d8b43f6bb77f96e12608dd6d6acbb934575a732551fd9420dfb988b8","logical_entry_identity":"32eafb9d84a83cdf52fe1aa5564ed6fe098d59d5c6e67550e4b32a000099c112","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Danger Sense","source_tag":"talent name","target":"危机感知"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70350b87d04f554ed2a5ee228097bf71fea0242d6b62a2fe1088bbd438b8d9f9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26c4ef052a66e0f679266501716e84aba20a3f2224cffa8b944b3e03558907fb","logical_entry_identity":"d520a4e2eb5b6d5c8441ab6c41376c6facb25d93e4a664f76e32f52a3e9892a9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ranged Defense: ","source_